# LANDFALL: blast pods (the Bombs' job): each pod burns one of a resource
# rolled per planet (beads here); without one, a buzz and that resource
# flashes on the HUD. Two at most lie lit. A pod goes off after a second
# and a half: foliage goes, a crystal goes too but throws shards (5 each)
# a moment later, an energy cell caught in it is lost for good, and Wick
# takes 2 if she's too close.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 2
cheat hold 3 -1
cheat pos 179 114
press A
expect bombs == 0
expect flash0 > 0
cheat res 0 5
press A
expect bombs == 1
expect res0 == 4
press A
expect bombs == 2
press A
expect bombs == 2
expect res0 == 3
# both go off: she is standing on them (hurt once: a moment of safety
# follows every hit)
cheat tile 12 7 6
wait 95
expect bombs == 0
expect hp == 1
expect last_hurt == 2
expect tile_12_7 == 0
# foliage two tiles away is out of reach
cheat hp 3 3
cheat tile 13 7 6
press A
hold LEFT 40
wait 60
expect tile_13_7 == 6
expect hp == 3
# a crystal: gone, and its shards fly a moment later
cheat pos 179 114
cheat tile 12 7 7
press A
hold LEFT 60
wait 30
expect tile_12_7 == 0
wait 24
expect shards > 0
wait 30
expect shards == 0
expect hp == 3
# an energy cell in the blast is lost
cheat thing 2 0 196 114
expect things2 == 5
cheat pos 179 100
press A
hold LEFT 60
wait 40
expect things2 == 4
